    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output: Rehabilitated electric power generation and transmission equipment of the Golovnaya hydropower plant 
Indicator: Generation units 1, 2, 3, 5 and 6 of Golovnaya hydropower plant commissioned in 2024. Generation unit 4 of Golovnaya hydropower plant commissioned in 2027 (OP1.3.1; OP3.1.4) 
Achievement: 5 
Progress/Status: Generation Units 1, 2, 3, 5, and 6 of the Golovnaya Hydropower Plant have been commissioned.

Generation Unit 4 is scheduled to be commissioned in 2027. Dismantling works for Unit 4 were completed on 30 October 2025, and shaft repair works are currently ongoing. Measurement works by the manufacturer&amp;apos;s representative have been completed.

The equipment design has been approved, and production of key components has commenced. To date, approximately 20% of the equipment has been manufactured. The first batch of equipment was shipped in December 2025, with the next delivery expected in February 2026.

Overall progress for Unit 4 rehabilitation works stands at approximately 17%. 
Data Source: Barki Tojik annual reports 

